### Geometry: the Compton camera alone in air, CH2 on top, looking up
### (setup of the cosmic-muon test in Sun et al., arXiv:2608.21216, Sec. 4.1)

/tof/det/stations false
/tof/det/frame false
/tof/det/stack false
/tof/det/absorber false
/tof/det/leadWalls false
/tof/det/camera true
/tof/det/worldSize 100 100 50 cm
/tof/camera/position 0 0 0 cm
/tof/camera/rotateX 0 deg
/update
